{"version":1,"content":"<p>【功夫 😱】中國機械人研發廠商宇樹科技（Unitree）21 日宣布，正式推出旗下最新款人形機械人「H2-X Kung Fu Legend Guardian」（功夫傳奇守護者）。</p><p>該款機種主打兼備服務與安全守護的多功能定位，官方宣稱其最高電池續航力可達約 8 小時，為長時間執勤與日常人機協同作業提供更穩定的動力支援。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T10:40:22.740882+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":159,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T10:36:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T01:37:54.236124+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T10:37:35.722228+00:00","content_hash":"dbe5831e2c979c66f6828e01ddd71f3df955183e098f6b6c537b3691435217a5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}